WEBVTT

00:08.740 --> 00:09.970
I'm Kumiko Komori.

00:10.550 --> 00:11.670
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:18.370 --> 00:19.000
That girl's...

00:19.860 --> 00:20.670
beautiful!

00:31.450 --> 00:31.990
Sama...

00:32.370 --> 00:32.860
tarou?

00:42.550 --> 00:44.670
Excuse me! I need to go to the bathroom.

00:49.070 --> 00:53.730
Ah, well, due to a situation in Komori's family, she's only going to be here for awhile, but...

00:53.930 --> 00:55.600
Please try to get along with her.

00:56.350 --> 00:56.920
Komori-san,

00:57.610 --> 00:59.250
Please sit in that open seat over there.

00:59.590 --> 01:00.140
Okay.

01:02.700 --> 01:04.420
Kumiko!

01:05.460 --> 01:06.240
Nice to meet you!

01:07.650 --> 01:08.570
Thanks!

01:20.390 --> 01:23.070
Ugh, why isn't the steam stopping?

01:31.370 --> 01:32.300
Stop!

01:33.390 --> 01:34.890
Stop already!

01:54.720 --> 02:00.040
dare mo shiranai basho de

01:54.720 --> 02:00.040
In a place uknown to everyone

02:00.860 --> 02:05.720
asa ga umare hajimeru

02:00.860 --> 02:05.720
The dawn is being born

02:06.270 --> 02:12.160
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

02:06.270 --> 02:12.160
The wishes you made upon a star

02:12.160 --> 02:18.060
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

02:12.160 --> 02:18.060
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:18.360 --> 02:26.970
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:18.360 --> 02:26.970
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

02:30.380 --> 02:33.290
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

02:30.380 --> 02:33.290
And my voice envelops the entire world

02:33.290 --> 02:36.430
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

02:33.290 --> 02:36.430
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

02:36.550 --> 02:39.310
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

02:36.550 --> 02:39.310
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

02:39.560 --> 02:42.450
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

02:39.560 --> 02:42.450
And you'll never really lose them

02:42.450 --> 02:45.530
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

02:42.450 --> 02:45.530
My fingers touch all of creation

02:45.530 --> 02:50.920
tobira akete haruka kanata e

02:45.530 --> 02:50.920
Open the door and escape to a distant place

03:09.290 --> 03:12.450
Operation: Samatarou's Extreme First Love!

03:09.290 --> 03:12.450
Timing, Editing, Muxing, "Translation": Chikushou
Please destroy this file upon subbing by a real group!

03:13.520 --> 03:15.950
Nurse's Office

03:20.640 --> 03:21.220
Alright!

03:27.570 --> 03:28.690
Hey...

03:28.810 --> 03:29.870
How're you feeling?

03:29.870 --> 03:32.720
Uh, were you not feeling well?

03:33.380 --> 03:35.940
It's rare for you to go to the nurse's office.

03:36.890 --> 03:37.920
You okay?

03:37.920 --> 03:39.210
I'm fine!

03:40.280 --> 03:42.060
That aside, what's up with you?

03:42.640 --> 03:43.930
It's like...

03:44.480 --> 03:46.320
My heart really hurts.

03:47.090 --> 03:50.140
H-hey! Where are you taking me?

03:50.280 --> 03:51.840
The nurse's office, of course!

03:52.320 --> 03:54.340
It's not like that, jeez.

03:56.210 --> 03:56.920
Then what is it?

03:57.410 --> 03:58.510
Dunno.

03:58.910 --> 04:02.330
When I saw Shinichi talk to that transfer student...

04:02.650 --> 04:04.000
My heart starting hurting.

04:04.890 --> 04:05.810
Could it be that...

04:06.270 --> 04:07.590
This is love?

04:08.020 --> 04:08.510
Love?

04:08.860 --> 04:12.330
Your heart was probably hurting because of jealously.

04:12.450 --> 04:13.400
Love?

04:14.290 --> 04:15.120
What's wrong?

04:16.130 --> 04:19.690
If everything turned out just how I wanted,

04:19.950 --> 04:21.360
It'd get boring.

04:21.820 --> 04:22.860
You know...

04:23.200 --> 04:25.790
If you're already thinking that way, nothing's ever going to happen.

04:26.190 --> 04:26.770
Okay?

04:27.970 --> 04:30.160
I wonder if it’s okay for me to fall in love with a regular human?

04:31.710 --> 04:32.600
Hold on a sec.

04:33.090 --> 04:34.620
I'll look in the Angel's Guidebook.

04:35.680 --> 04:38.410
Things a god is and isn't allowed to do...

04:38.780 --> 04:40.250
L..love...

04:40.540 --> 04:41.260
There we go.

04:41.340 --> 04:43.300
It says love isn't a problem.

04:43.590 --> 04:45.830
In fact, it says you should really go for it.

04:45.940 --> 04:47.180
It's very much recommended!

04:47.840 --> 04:51.090
"Love is the most important human emotion to know."

04:51.610 --> 04:53.070
Is what it says.

04:53.220 --> 04:54.790
How about you try winning that girl's heart?

04:55.920 --> 04:56.980
Yeah...

05:04.290 --> 05:05.120
Hello.

05:05.460 --> 05:07.250
My name is, umm, Kamiyama, but...

05:07.360 --> 05:09.370
Eh? Um. Hello.

05:09.580 --> 05:11.370
Umm... I uh...

05:11.670 --> 05:13.600
I kind of need to talk to you.

05:14.350 --> 05:16.390
Would you like to go out with me after school?

05:16.620 --> 05:20.010
I'm sorry, but I have to help finish up our preparations to move, so...

05:20.160 --> 05:21.050
Today's a little...

05:24.010 --> 05:24.530
Um...

05:26.680 --> 05:29.360
Really? Well okay. Bye then!

05:33.150 --> 05:33.960
I got rejected!

05:34.130 --> 05:35.510
W-why?

05:35.970 --> 05:37.150
She can't help it, you know.

05:37.410 --> 05:38.410
She has something to do.

05:38.610 --> 05:41.340
But... Why did I get rejected?

05:41.490 --> 05:44.050
I thought God would've granted my wish by now.

05:44.220 --> 05:45.660
Now that you mention it, yeah...

05:46.030 --> 05:47.350
What's Papa up to?

05:48.470 --> 05:50.200
He should be taking a nap about now.

05:48.470 --> 05:50.200
Note: In the previous episode, I messed this up. His dad can read his thoughts when he sleeps.

05:51.980 --> 05:54.140
But, isn't this a good chance?

05:55.210 --> 05:57.820
You've been unhappy all this time, haven't you?

05:58.360 --> 05:59.800
In that "boring" life of yours.

05:59.970 --> 06:00.840
Yeah...

06:01.070 --> 06:01.640
And?

06:02.220 --> 06:04.570
If we keep it a secret from Papa and the others...

06:04.980 --> 06:07.790
You can try to win her heart without the interference of God's miracles.

06:08.170 --> 06:09.000
You're right.

06:09.150 --> 06:10.550
It really is a good chance.

06:10.840 --> 06:11.530
I'll do it!

06:11.850 --> 06:12.600
Good.

06:12.830 --> 06:15.440
Being rejected once is nothing!

06:17.370 --> 06:18.430
"Rejected..."

06:18.890 --> 06:20.700
Quit that pathetic crouching.

06:22.090 --> 06:23.350
You we really nervous, right?

06:24.070 --> 06:26.340
Don't just sit there! Get up and take the challenge!

06:26.510 --> 06:26.970
Okay?

06:26.940 --> 06:27.950
G-got it.

06:28.260 --> 06:31.940
Alright! I'm gonna do something about this love with my own power.

06:33.900 --> 06:35.480
We're home!

06:36.340 --> 06:38.900
Welcome baaack~

06:43.530 --> 06:45.260
What do you think you're doing?!

06:45.260 --> 06:46.720
It's a naked apron!

06:46.720 --> 06:49.020
I thought my little Samatarou would be happy to see this.

06:49.280 --> 06:50.320
That's right!

06:51.060 --> 06:55.920
Wearing an apron while naked is enough to make a man's heart race!

06:56.270 --> 06:57.960
Even you! Quit it, Pops!

06:58.310 --> 06:59.750
I can't stand them sometimes.

06:59.750 --> 07:04.440
I thought he would be happy about this!

07:02.910 --> 07:06.620
That's weird.  But Tenko likes it, right? Naked aprons...

07:13.000 --> 07:14.010
I hate them!

07:15.410 --> 07:16.820
That was well executed.

07:17.890 --> 07:22.230
By the way, Tenko. I wasn't able to synch up with Samatarou's thoughts earlier today.

07:22.230 --> 07:24.010
You know anything about that?

07:24.240 --> 07:27.200
Even though he's wearing a naked apron, he's still God. Sharp observation.

07:27.200 --> 07:28.380
I'll have to make something up.

07:28.380 --> 07:29.270
Dunno!

07:29.650 --> 07:32.870
I wasn't able to synch up with your thoughts at that time, either.

07:32.870 --> 07:33.900
Did something happen?

07:34.190 --> 07:36.600
Maybe it's just your imagination?

07:36.980 --> 07:37.700
Maybe...

07:40.480 --> 07:42.960
I finally have something to write about in my diary!

07:43.620 --> 07:46.460
Today, I fell in love for the first time.

07:47.560 --> 07:51.410
Do your best tomorrow, Samatarou. I hope your love will steadily bloom.

07:57.190 --> 07:59.030
Because I'm an angel...

08:04.610 --> 08:05.530
Kamiyama.

08:05.760 --> 08:07.600
I have something I'd like to talk to you about.

08:07.770 --> 08:10.330
Please meet me behind the gym after school.

08:16.570 --> 08:18.000
What could she want all of the sudden?

08:18.200 --> 08:20.130
Did Papa and the rest of them find out?

08:21.110 --> 08:23.060
She's probably...

08:23.290 --> 08:25.250
Caught up in my boyish charm.

08:25.650 --> 08:26.890
I wonder about that.

08:27.000 --> 08:29.160
And why behind the gym?

08:29.910 --> 08:31.490
She wasn't pressured into this, was she?

08:32.090 --> 08:34.280
It'd be hard to talk in the classroom, wouldn't it?

08:34.650 --> 08:35.770
So uh...

08:36.290 --> 08:38.240
Why did you follow me here?

08:38.300 --> 08:38.730
Huh?

08:39.710 --> 08:40.830
It's 'cause I'm an angel.

08:41.550 --> 08:43.790
Anyway, go hide over there.

08:44.510 --> 08:46.700
If you're here, Komori-san's going to be afraid of coming.

08:47.010 --> 08:47.900
Okay, okay.

08:48.020 --> 08:50.200
This nuisance will disappear now.

08:54.080 --> 08:55.150
Kamiyama-kun!

08:56.900 --> 08:58.710
Sorry! Did you wait long?

08:58.860 --> 09:00.150
No, not at all.

09:00.500 --> 09:02.390
So, what did you wanna talk about?

09:03.170 --> 09:04.390
Actually...

09:07.400 --> 09:08.460
I like you!

09:08.630 --> 09:09.840
Take me!

09:13.630 --> 09:14.780
Komori...

09:14.810 --> 09:15.820
Samatarou...

09:15.960 --> 09:16.570
I love you!

09:22.550 --> 09:23.640
I've wanted you since I first saw you.

09:24.160 --> 09:27.030
People already thought we were lovers.

09:28.380 --> 09:29.820
Samatarou

09:30.140 --> 09:31.340
Hold me!

09:34.560 --> 09:37.040
I knew it. She likes me.

09:37.300 --> 09:41.550
No doubt, this was a chance given to me by God.

09:41.550 --> 09:42.620
God?

09:44.330 --> 09:46.040
Pops! It was you, huh!

09:47.830 --> 09:49.570
Looks like you caught me.

09:50.600 --> 09:52.160
What did you do to her?

09:52.450 --> 09:54.850
I just made her take a liking to you.

09:55.090 --> 09:57.450
Don't do that. Stuff like that is just too weird!

09:57.630 --> 09:58.380
Really?

09:58.510 --> 10:00.740
It worked when I did this with your mom.

10:01.210 --> 10:02.220
Papa!

10:02.220 --> 10:03.460
Quit getting in the way!

10:03.500 --> 10:07.300
Samatarou was going to do something major on his own for the first time.

10:07.550 --> 10:09.480
It said so in my guidebook!

10:09.720 --> 10:13.090
But you wanted to go out with her, right?

10:13.650 --> 10:15.640
I was gonna do it on my own!

10:15.980 --> 10:17.660
Hurry up and turn her back to normal!

10:17.750 --> 10:20.240
Eh? I just went through all the trouble of making a miracle.

10:20.370 --> 10:22.090
"The trouble?" What the hell?

10:22.090 --> 10:23.810
C'mon! Turn her back, you ass!

10:23.880 --> 10:25.330
Okay. Fine.

10:34.990 --> 10:35.940
Where am I?

10:36.440 --> 10:37.910
Behind the gym.

10:38.040 --> 10:39.220
It's okay now.

10:39.400 --> 10:40.670
O-okay.

10:40.890 --> 10:41.530
Tha--

10:46.800 --> 10:48.590
What the hell did you do to me?!

10:48.970 --> 10:50.440
Hey, Tenko...

10:50.640 --> 10:52.450
You think this love affair is going well?

10:53.270 --> 10:54.150
No way.

10:54.830 --> 10:55.890
Yeah...

10:56.870 --> 10:58.520
This is unforgivable.

10:59.040 --> 11:01.600
He's probably sitting up there heartbroken.

11:02.300 --> 11:04.510
He's my sweet little Samatarou!

11:04.510 --> 11:08.270
How come he has to fall in love with girls other than his wonderful mother?

11:08.340 --> 11:08.970
Jeez!

11:09.560 --> 11:13.590
Don't get so upset. He only started showing interest in girls yesterday.

11:13.700 --> 11:14.130
Right?

11:14.450 --> 11:15.060
Dunno.

11:15.400 --> 11:16.660
You don't care about this, do you?

11:17.070 --> 11:19.900
Is there <i>anything</i> you're interested in?

11:20.980 --> 11:21.710
Jellyfish...

11:31.080 --> 11:32.640
Samatarou, you there?

11:35.100 --> 11:35.920
I'm coming in.

11:39.810 --> 11:40.440
Hey.

11:40.690 --> 11:42.160
Don't feel so down.

11:42.910 --> 11:44.650
It was only a slight misunderstanding.

11:48.900 --> 11:50.530
You can't understand a girl's heart.

11:51.080 --> 11:53.180
You might still be able to hit a come from behind homerun with her.

11:53.500 --> 11:56.570
Why does everyone always have to get in my way?

11:57.640 --> 11:58.750
It's my first love...

11:59.540 --> 12:01.980
I thought I'd try my hardest at this.

12:02.210 --> 12:03.810
But Pops had to go and use miracles.

12:04.090 --> 12:06.640
And Ma's acting all jealous for some reason.

12:06.850 --> 12:10.380
But Papa's only doing this because he cares about you.

12:10.580 --> 12:12.520
Screw it. I give up.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.090
Samatarou...

12:15.170 --> 12:16.480
Shut it!

12:16.710 --> 12:17.750
You're fuckin' annoying!

12:18.070 --> 12:21.480
I, a candidate for goddess, reject every single guy who makes a pass at me!

12:21.670 --> 12:24.520
Everyone's thinking about the same thing, but just thinking is pointless.

12:25.100 --> 12:27.730
So don't wimp out. Get fired up!

12:27.980 --> 12:30.290
If you can't do that, you'll never become a god.

12:30.530 --> 12:32.710
Boys without any courage are useless.

12:33.140 --> 12:35.510
First, you have to take the initiative. Got it?

12:39.110 --> 12:41.440
Sis, don't use your weird sorcery on me!

12:41.690 --> 12:43.440
Tada, a present!

12:44.580 --> 12:46.300
Passes to the pool?

12:46.550 --> 12:47.460
Why four?

12:47.890 --> 12:50.960
Group socialization helps out in early dates, you know.

13:07.190 --> 13:08.970
Why should I say I invited her?

13:09.200 --> 13:11.100
Say you want to become friends, and have a good time with her.

13:11.350 --> 13:13.480
Just act like what happened before was a misunderstanding.

13:14.200 --> 13:17.370
You just helped Kumiko-san when she collapsed.

13:17.890 --> 13:19.920
It's going to be crowded there, so...

13:20.130 --> 13:22.550
At least try to hold hands with her or something.

13:23.160 --> 13:24.000
I'll try.

13:24.490 --> 13:25.690
Hey!

13:26.300 --> 13:27.660
You guys!

13:27.660 --> 13:29.040
Hey, Shin-chan!

13:29.090 --> 13:30.330
Hey, what're you...

13:30.830 --> 13:33.090
To be blunt, today you're my clown.

13:33.880 --> 13:36.260
Today the two of us will have an exciting date,

13:36.420 --> 13:39.590
Since our goal is to make sure things go well between Samatarou and Kumiko.

13:40.420 --> 13:41.530
Huh? Why?

13:42.030 --> 13:44.500
You two aren't going out?

13:44.790 --> 13:46.850
We aren't like that!

13:47.050 --> 13:48.090
Don't get weird ideas.

13:48.160 --> 13:48.550
Dumbass.

13:51.620 --> 13:52.640
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

13:59.160 --> 14:00.110
Kumiko!

14:04.160 --> 14:04.990
Kamiyama,

14:06.370 --> 14:07.870
I'm sorry about yesterday.

14:08.300 --> 14:10.810
Ah, no. It wasn't a problem at all.

14:11.120 --> 14:12.140
Alright, let's go.

14:14.680 --> 14:17.940
Hey, Tenko! Why are you holding hands with a guy like Shinichi?

14:18.500 --> 14:21.420
So it'll be easier for you and Kumiko to hold hands!

14:21.940 --> 14:22.620
Sheesh.

14:26.190 --> 14:27.620
Um... should we get going?

14:28.340 --> 14:29.540
Ah... yeah.

14:29.750 --> 14:30.540
Let's go.

14:45.470 --> 14:46.670
Samatarou...

14:46.670 --> 14:48.120
I don't quite get what you're doing.

14:48.370 --> 14:48.950
What do you mean?

14:49.430 --> 14:52.080
Well, you know... Kumiko is pretty cute.

14:52.820 --> 14:56.350
But.. you've always been so close to Tenko up until now.

14:56.350 --> 14:58.180
What's with the sudden change of heart?

14:58.370 --> 15:02.140
I told you, we aren't like that!

15:03.070 --> 15:06.280
Did you know Tenko's really popular with the guys?

15:06.900 --> 15:08.190
Huh? She is?

15:09.200 --> 15:12.350
It may be a little out of place, but she's friggin' cute!

15:13.070 --> 15:14.360
She's not model material or anything, but...

15:14.500 --> 15:17.260
It's not that weird to find her attractive.

15:19.000 --> 15:19.610
You...

15:19.840 --> 15:20.580
Really don't...

15:20.740 --> 15:22.210
Have any feelings for Tenko?

15:23.370 --> 15:23.980
Not really.

15:24.340 --> 15:26.040
In that case, I'll enjoy myself today.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.100
With her.

15:32.670 --> 15:33.300
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

15:37.260 --> 15:37.940
How's this look?

15:38.750 --> 15:40.000
Cute!

15:40.180 --> 15:41.780
Tenko, you're like an angel!

15:42.620 --> 15:43.390
Really?

15:44.910 --> 15:47.150
Hey, what're you gonna do if he finds out about your true form?

15:47.530 --> 15:48.590
It's fine!

15:50.060 --> 15:51.830
Tenko, where's Kumiko?

15:51.780 --> 15:52.580
She's here.

15:53.280 --> 15:54.230
Kumiko!

15:54.230 --> 15:55.310
What're you hiding for?

15:56.740 --> 15:57.780
But...

15:57.780 --> 15:58.910
It's embarrassing.

15:59.880 --> 16:01.510
It's the swimsuit you chose yourself, isn't it?

16:02.010 --> 16:03.480
So it shouldn't be embarrassing.

16:03.890 --> 16:04.360
C'mon!

16:10.220 --> 16:10.770
Um...

16:11.170 --> 16:12.780
Please don't look so much.

16:13.230 --> 16:15.270
Ah... S-s-sorry.

16:17.150 --> 16:19.540
Take that! And that!

16:18.300 --> 16:20.900
It's cold! Get ready for my attack!

16:22.870 --> 16:25.040
<i>You think you can beat me?</i>

16:26.690 --> 16:27.350
C'mon.

16:27.460 --> 16:29.430
Go have fun with Kumiko.

16:30.040 --> 16:31.670
Even if you tell me to do that...

16:32.060 --> 16:33.190
Take that!

16:34.660 --> 16:35.680
Now you've done it!

16:38.120 --> 16:39.610
It's Samatarou!

16:40.340 --> 16:42.400
Samatarou!

16:42.510 --> 16:44.360
Kamiyama, do you know them?

16:44.820 --> 16:45.950
Nope, not at all.

16:47.330 --> 16:48.370
Who're you guys?

16:48.890 --> 16:51.240
Samatarou talked to me!

16:51.510 --> 16:52.850
Lucky!

16:52.940 --> 16:54.790
No fair! I want him to talk to me, too!

16:54.790 --> 16:56.450
Samatarou, kiss me!

16:56.540 --> 16:58.320
Samatarou, hold me!

17:07.550 --> 17:08.190
Oww!

17:09.430 --> 17:11.040
Sis, I know you were up to something!

17:11.920 --> 17:13.140
Busted!

17:23.370 --> 17:24.460
Samatarou!

17:24.860 --> 17:26.240
What the hell are you doing?

17:26.740 --> 17:30.540
"What am I doing"? Helping out with your first love, of course!

17:30.810 --> 17:33.320
I'm using my powers as a goddess to control them.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.450
Meme, you too!?

17:41.700 --> 17:43.450
Kumiko, was it?

17:43.450 --> 17:45.900
In order to get her a little jealous,

17:45.970 --> 17:47.650
I thought I'd give her a little show.

17:47.710 --> 17:48.890
You went too far!

17:49.160 --> 17:51.400
And why are they doing this to me?

17:52.150 --> 17:52.740
Why?

17:53.370 --> 17:53.820
Dunno.

17:54.050 --> 17:55.630
Maybe they're caught up in the moment.

17:55.630 --> 17:56.520
Guess I'll stop.

18:00.970 --> 18:01.450
Huh?

18:01.650 --> 18:03.450
What am I doing?

18:03.780 --> 18:04.910
Who's this dweeb?

18:08.330 --> 18:10.570
Sheesh, getting mistaken for someone else can be scary.

18:13.780 --> 18:15.570
Y-yeah...

18:15.750 --> 18:17.310
You were mistaken for someone else.

18:23.620 --> 18:24.230
Hey!

18:24.320 --> 18:25.380
Let's go over there!

18:29.680 --> 18:32.420
Got it? Squeeze her tightly and get close to her!

18:32.720 --> 18:34.050
Get close to her?

18:34.280 --> 18:35.450
How do I do that?

18:35.450 --> 18:36.630
Like this!

18:37.920 --> 18:40.340
Tenko! What are you...

18:41.380 --> 18:42.170
Let's slide together,

18:42.440 --> 18:43.350
Shinichi!

18:43.600 --> 18:44.140
Here we go!

18:52.330 --> 18:52.900
Okay?

18:52.900 --> 18:54.570
If you do that, you'll definitely be able to make a move!

18:55.270 --> 18:56.860
He didn't have to hold her so close.

18:57.330 --> 18:58.100
Kamiyama-kun.

18:58.460 --> 18:59.660
We're blocking everyone's way.

18:59.840 --> 19:00.200
Huh?

19:03.490 --> 19:05.090
I can't do something like that.

19:05.500 --> 19:06.470
It's totally impossible.

19:06.950 --> 19:07.490
Um...

19:07.900 --> 19:09.710
Will you slide with me?

19:09.870 --> 19:10.160
Eh?

19:10.610 --> 19:11.920
I'd be afraid by myself.

19:12.420 --> 19:13.710
If it's not a bother...

19:14.030 --> 19:15.820
It's not a bother. Are you sure?

19:16.380 --> 19:17.540
Please.

19:21.200 --> 19:22.150
You ready?

19:22.540 --> 19:22.990
Yep.

19:31.540 --> 19:34.120
Kamiyama, was it always this long?

19:34.190 --> 19:36.740
Eh, well, it just seems long 'cause you're scared.

19:37.810 --> 19:39.260
Could this possibly be...

19:40.020 --> 19:41.990
Samatarou, enjoying yourself?

19:42.040 --> 19:43.490
Getting hugged like that.

19:44.530 --> 19:45.880
So it was you!

19:47.400 --> 19:48.420
What the hell is that?

19:49.100 --> 19:50.500
I stretched it out!

19:52.510 --> 19:55.680
But see, the longer you're in there, the more fun!

19:56.790 --> 19:58.170
Kumiyama!

19:59.030 --> 20:00.340
You've scared her plenty, haven't you?

20:00.610 --> 20:01.740
Stop it right now!

20:02.200 --> 20:05.090
I'm just trying to make your date more exciting.

20:11.070 --> 20:12.720
You're going overboard again!

20:12.850 --> 20:13.920
Not quite yet!

20:18.830 --> 20:20.480
Why do you have to do this now?

20:20.930 --> 20:22.420
Here, have a bonus!

20:26.250 --> 20:27.760
I set it on fire!

20:27.810 --> 20:30.800
It's burning! Cut it out right now!

20:30.890 --> 20:33.010
You're so annoying, jeez.

20:39.600 --> 20:41.250
Komori, are you okay?

20:41.340 --> 20:42.020
Yes.

20:51.950 --> 20:54.370
Kamiyama, you pervert!

21:02.830 --> 21:06.470
Man, that wave pool was awesome!

21:06.950 --> 21:09.140
When the waves started, I thought I was gonna die.

21:09.140 --> 21:10.590
But you saved me so,

21:10.730 --> 21:14.280
I was fine. I didn't think I was gonna make it if not for you.

21:11.860 --> 21:12.610
Yeah.

21:13.600 --> 21:14.420
...Yeah.

21:15.430 --> 21:16.470
I got rejected again...

21:17.240 --> 21:18.780
I'm telling you it's not like that!

21:18.940 --> 21:20.750
You got to have fun in the water.

21:20.950 --> 21:22.740
And go down the waterslide together.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.740
Isn't that nice?

21:24.760 --> 21:26.660
But she thinks I'm a pervert...

21:26.950 --> 21:27.920
It's over...

21:31.590 --> 21:32.150
What?

21:33.040 --> 21:34.280
I'll hold your hand

21:34.600 --> 21:36.360
in Kumiko's place.

21:37.540 --> 21:39.530
You holding my hand won't make me happy.

21:41.290 --> 21:43.470
I'm just trying to cheer you up, okay?

21:43.900 --> 21:45.430
Hey, look at that!

21:45.680 --> 21:46.970
Such a pretty sunset!

21:57.380 --> 22:01.430
Now that I think about it, Tenko used to hold my hand a lot in the past.

22:02.700 --> 22:06.090
There's still three days before Kumiko transfers again, you know.

22:06.410 --> 22:06.880
Try your best!

22:10.050 --> 22:10.750
Okay.

22:15.480 --> 22:17.650
Kumiko, you wanna go to karaoke after this?

22:17.650 --> 22:19.800
<i>I bet you're great at singing.</i>

22:19.800 --> 22:22.420
<i>That place they just opened up is the best!</i>

22:22.500 --> 22:23.540
<i>You probably look cool doing it.</i>

22:23.650 --> 22:25.960
<i>Hey, are you listening? 'Cause I was...</i>

22:40.420 --> 22:45.910
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.420 --> 22:45.910
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.780 --> 22:52.370
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.780 --> 22:52.370
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.780 --> 22:56.760
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.780 --> 22:56.760
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.620 --> 23:04.360
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.620 --> 23:04.360
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.870 --> 23:11.060
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.870 --> 23:11.060
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.300 --> 23:17.650
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.300 --> 23:17.650
Even if I put a doughnut over my head

23:18.530 --> 23:24.770
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.530 --> 23:24.770
It wouldn't be enough to make me look like an angel!

23:26.040 --> 23:31.990
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:26.040 --> 23:31.990
Oh, please, God, allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.990 --> 23:37.720
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.990 --> 23:37.720
Grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.750 --> 23:39.600
kotaenasai

23:37.750 --> 23:39.600
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.630 --> 23:47.410
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.630 --> 23:47.410
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.450 --> 23:52.580
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.450 --> 23:52.580
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:03.990 --> 24:07.060
Komori-shan ish gonna reabbbbb!

24:07.060 --> 24:08.280
Don't give up!

24:08.280 --> 24:09.630
The next step is...

24:09.630 --> 24:11.110
A present?

24:11.230 --> 24:13.110
Hey, this is cute! Buy it!

24:13.110 --> 24:14.670
Why would I chose something you like?

24:14.850 --> 24:19.950
The technique for winning a woman involves proper use of wine and roses.

24:20.010 --> 24:21.950
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku:

24:21.950 --> 24:23.870
Trembling Heart Roulette

24:24.240 --> 24:25.870
Leave it to Meme.

24:25.870 --> 24:26.820
Okay?
